-----sequential model------
->layers are arranged one after another in a linear sequences
->data flows from input layer to one or more output layer
WHY WE USE THIS
->we use this when the sequential neural network has only one input and one output, 
and the layers are connected in a sttraight line
-------DENSE----
->it is fully connected network
->every neuron in a layer is connected to its previous layer
->it is most commmonly used layer in keras
-> dense uses the activation function
WHAT DOES THIS DO
->Receives input from the previous layer.
->Performs calculations using weights and biases.
->Applies an activation function.
->Passes the output to the next layer.
-------ACTIVATION FUNCTION-------------
-> it is a mathematical functon used in neural network that decides the output of a neuron
->it helps to understand the complex pattern and determines whether the information should passes to the next layer
-> it improves the model's ability to make accurate predictions
-> neurn first calculate the value and activation function decides whether the output is sent to sent layer or not
----COMMON ACTIVATION FUNCTION----
RELU-Rectified Linear Unit
-> it is most commenly used activation function in deep learning 
->it allows only positive values to pass through and conver all negative value to zero
->ReLU(x)=max(0,x)
-> this means
if x>0 , output = x
if x<=0, output = 0
->dense value  is 32, 64, 128, 256, 512 for hidden layer
SIGMOID ACTIVATION FUNCTION
->sigmoid activation function is a mathematical function tha converts any input value into an output between 0 and 1.
->σ(x)=1/1+e−x​
-> x is a input value 
->e^-x is eulers number (approx 2.718)
->large negative input is close to 0
->zero input ->output is 0.5
->large positive input is close to 1
->used in face recognition for match and no match
-> dense value is 1 for output(binary classification)
SOFTMAX ACTIVATION FUNCTION
->The Softmax activation function is an activation function that converts the output of a neural network into probabilities.
->It is mainly used for multi-class classification, where the model must choose one class from multiple possible classes.
->it is used for 3 or more
​​->dense value is number of classes for ouput (multi-class classification)
---------OPTIMIZER---------
->An optimizer is an algorithm that learns from the model's mistakes by updating the weights and biases to reduce the loss and improve prediction accuracy.
